[2026-02-04T00:02:43.759Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WibsiQt56wZ3rY4AwLrroj","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"site:bloomberg.com market claims predictions 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Stock Market Predictions 2026: AI Boom, Dollar’s Decline and Sticky Inflation\",\"url\":\"https://www.bloomberg.com/graphics/2026-investment-outlooks/\"},{\"title\":\"Wall Street Predictions 2026: Every Analyst Now Predicts Stock Rally - Bloomberg\",\"url\":\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-12-29/bulls-only-every-wall-street-analyst-now-predicts-a-stock-rally\"},{\"title\":\"Make Your Picks on Businessweek’s 2026 Prediction Market\",\"url\":\"https://www.bloomberg.com/features/prediction-market-2026/\"},{\"title\":\"2026 Predictions on AI, Trump, the Fed and Housing\",\"url\":\"https://www.bloomberg.com/graphics/2026-opinion-predictions-ai-trump-the-fed-housing/\"},{\"title\":\"Predicting a 16% S&P Rally for 2026: Evening Briefing Americas - Bloomberg\",\"url\":\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2025-11-17/predicting-a-16-s-p-rally-for-2026-evening-briefing-americas\"},{\"title\":\"M&A Boom Has Room to Run: Dealmakers’ Predictions for 2026 - Bloomberg\",\"url\":\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-12-22/m-a-boom-has-room-to-run-dealmakers-predictions-for-2026\"},{\"title\":\"2026 Predictions on AI, Biotech and Business From Senior Finance Leaders - Bloomberg\",\"url\":\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2025-12-15/2026-predictions-on-ai-biotech-and-business-from-senior-finance-leaders\"},{\"title\":\"OPEC Data Point to Balanced Global Oil Market in 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-12-11/opec-data-point-to-balanced-global-oil-market-in-2026\"},{\"title\":\"Wall Street Is Bullish on 2026 Stock Gains. Assume That’s Wrong - Bloomberg\",\"url\":\"https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2025-12-22/wall-street-is-bullish-on-2026-stock-gains-assume-that-s-wrong\"},{\"title\":\"Muni Strategists Anticipate Issuance to Top $600 Billion in 2026 - Bloomberg\",\"url\":\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-12-05/muni-strategists-anticipate-issuance-to-top-600-billion-in-2026\"}]\n\nHere are the search results from Bloomberg.com regarding market claims and predictions for 2026:\n\n## Stock Market Predictions\n\nAt the big banks and the boutique investment shops, an optimistic consensus has taken hold: the US stock market will rally in 2026 for a fourth straight year, marking the longest winning streak in nearly two decades.\n\nFidelity International calls AI \"the defining theme for equity markets\" in 2026. The BlackRock Investment Institute says the tech will likely \"keep trumping tariffs and traditional macro drivers.\"\n\nWilson said he expects the benchmark (S&P 500) to trade around 7,800 points by end-2026, with strong corporate earnings leading the way. And there are more than a few people on Wall Street betting the same way.\n\nIt's crystal ball season again on Wall Street — the time when strategists attempt the impossible task of divining where the S&P 500 Index will end the next calendar year. This time around, strategists are projecting a relatively bullish 11% gain over the next 12 months.\n\n## Key Themes and Risks\n\nWhen it comes to risks to the outlook, the worries are conventional: Geopolitics, trade barriers, and a weakening US labor market (BCA's chief concern).\n\nValuations of key assets remain elevated, with many equities looking pricey and credit spreads extremely tight. US tariffs remain in place, acting as a brake on global growth. Inflation is still not vanquished.\n\n## AI and Business Predictions\n\nSenior finance leaders expressed a mix of conviction and caution: from general bullishness on the US, AI-driven productivity and biotechnology breakthroughs to worries about changing global alliances, inflation and technology adoption.\n\nAI's astronomically expensive future will be underwritten in the debt markets. That's a vast amount of credit risk to gulp down.\n\n## Oil Market\n\nOPEC kept forecasts for global oil supplies and demand in 2026 steady, pointing to a balanced world market that clashes with widespread predictions of a surplus. The Organization of the Petroleum Exporting Countries and its allies will need to produce an average of 43 million barrels a day next year to balance supply and demand.\n\n## Municipal Bond Market\n\nStrategists in the municipal bond market are mostly predicting local governments will sell at least $600 billion of debt in 2026, eclipsing the record amount already offered this year as issuers look to refund outstanding debt and plug holes from federal funding cuts.\n\n## Prediction Markets\n\nPrediction markets such as Polymarket and Kalshi let bettors wager on everything—wars, elections, Elon Musk's weekly X posts. As pollsters falter and sports gambling rules ease under President Donald Trump, these platforms have emerged as informal oracles that many believe can help predict economic indicators and major cultural events.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fc19be83-c5d4-4d22-a1ea-f9f460ee03af","uuid":"cddf49d3-cfc0-4c5d-a06a-2ab7138bfcab","tool_use_result":{"query":"site:bloomberg.com market claims predictions 2026","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01FUG7yMkToWwDbnj5fm4we1","content":[{"title":"Stock Market Predictions 2026: AI Boom, Dollar’s Decline and Sticky Inflation","url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/graphics/2026-investment-outlooks/"},{"title":"Wall Street Predictions 2026: Every Analyst Now Predicts Stock Rally - Bloomberg","url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-12-29/bulls-only-every-wall-street-analyst-now-predicts-a-stock-rally"},{"title":"Make Your Picks on Businessweek’s 2026 Prediction Market","url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/features/prediction-m