ctual verified savings from DOGE operations versus their claims, and what was the net fiscal impact including severance costs and program disruptions?\",\n      \"suggestedTemplate\": \"debunk_claim\",\n      \"sourceBias\": \"center-left\",\n      \"debunkable\": 5\n    },\n    {\n      \"sourceSlug\": \"aljazeera\",\n      \"title\": \"Russia-Ukraine Trilateral Talks Resume in Abu Dhabi\",\n      \"description\": \"New round of US-Russia-Ukraine peace talks postponed to February 4-5 with territory disputes remaining central\",\n      \"sourceUrl\": \"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/2/1/trilateral-ukraine-talks-set-to-resume-in-abu-dhabi-on-wednesday-zelenskyy\",\n      \"signals\": [\"breaking\"],\n      \"claim\": \"Russia is demanding Ukraine cede a fifth of the Donetsk region it still controls as a condition for peace negotiations\",\n      \"researchQuery\": \"What specific territorial demands has Russia made in the 2026 peace negotiations, and how do they compare to pre-war boundaries and current control lines?\",\n      \"suggestedTemplate\": \"event_timeline\",\n      \"sourceBias\": \"left\",\n      \"debunkable\": 4\n    },\n    {\n      \"sourceSlug\": \"cnn\",\n      \"title\": \"Amazon Layoffs Total 30,000 Corporate Workers\",\n      \"description\": \"Amazon plans to reduce corporate workforce by 16,000 following 14,000 cuts in October 2025\",\n      \"sourceUrl\": \"https://www.cnn.com/2026/01/31/tech/amazon-layoffs-january-tech-changes\",\n      \"signals\": [\"breaking\", \"trending\"],\n      \"claim\": \"Amazon is cutting 30,000 corporate jobs (10% of corporate workforce) while 55% of companies cite AI as a primary driver of 2026 layoffs\",\n      \"researchQuery\": \"What evidence supports the claim that AI implementation is driving 2026 tech layoffs, and how do current layoff rates compare to previous tech downturns?\",\n      \"suggestedTemplate\": \"actor_investigation\",\n      \"sourceBias\": \"center-left\",\n      \"debunkable\": 5\n    },\n    {\n      \"sourceSlug\": \"washingtonpost\",\n      \"title\": \"Whistleblower: Israeli Military Used Google Gemini AI\",\n      \"description\": \"SEC complaint alleges Google breached ethics rules to help Israeli contractor apply AI to drone surveillance\",\n      \"sourceUrl\": \"https://www.washingtonpost.com/technology/2026/02/01/google-ai-israel-military/\",\n      \"signals\": [\"breaking\", \"controversial\"],\n      \"claim\": \"Google breached its own AI ethics rules by allowing an Israeli military contractor to use Gemini AI for drone surveillance video analysis\",\n      \"researchQuery\": \"What are Google's stated AI ethics policies regarding military applications, and what evidence exists that they were violated in the Israeli contractor case?\",\n      \"suggestedTemplate\": \"actor_investigation\",\n      \"sourceBias\": \"center-left\",\n      \"debunkable\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"sourceSlug\": \"npr\",\n      \"title\": \"Mistaken Deportations Increasing Under Trump Administration\",\n      \"description\": \"Immigration lawyers report wrongful deportation cases are getting worse, not better, following landmark Abrego Garcia case\",\n      \"sourceUrl\": \"https://www.npr.org/2026/02/03/g-s1-108426/trump-kilmar-abrego-garcia-immigration-mistaken-deportations\",\n      \"signals\": [\"controversial\", \"trending\"],\n      \"claim\": \"More than 170 U.S. citizens have been detained in immigration enforcement due to database errors, and wrongful deportations are increasing despite a landmark court case\",\n      \"researchQuery\": \"How many documented cases of U.S. citizens or protected individuals being wrongfully detained or deported exist in 2025-2026, and what systemic failures enabled them?\",\n      \"suggestedTemplate\": \"investigative\",\n      \"sourceBias\": \"center-left\",\n      \"debunkable\": 4\n    },\n    {\n      \"sourceSlug\": \"taxfoundation\",\n      \"title\": \"Trump Tariffs Raise Average Rate to 17%, Highest Since 1930s\",\n      \"description\": \"U.S. average effective tariff rate increased from 2.4% to 16.8%, potentially rising to 21%\",\n      \"sourceUrl\": \"https://taxfoundation.org/research/all/federal/trump-tariffs-trade-war/\",\n      \"signals\": [\"trending\"],\n      \"claim\": \"Trump tariffs represent the largest US tax increase as percent of GDP since 1993, costing households an average of $1,300 in 2026\",\n      \"researchQuery\": \"What is the verified economic impact of Trump tariffs on U.S. households, and how does the $1,300 per household estimate compare to actual consumer price data?\",\n      \"suggestedTemplate\": \"policy_analysis\",\n      \"sourceBias\": \"center\",\n      \"debunkable\": 5\n    },\n    {\n      \"sourceSlug\": \"npr\",\n      \"title\": \"16 Drug Companies Raised Prices Despite Trump Deals\",\n      \"description\": \"All 16 pharmaceutical companies with Trump administration pricing deals still raised prices on other drugs in 2026\",\n      \"sourceUrl\": \"https://www.npr.org/2026/01/16/nx-s1-5678915/trumprx-pharma-drug-price-deals-list-prices\",\n      \"signals\": [\"controversial\"],\n      \"claim\": \"All 16 drug companies that made deals with the Trump administration raised prices on 872 brand-name drugs in January 2026, while the deals only apply to Medicaid patients\",\n      \"researchQuery\": \"What specific drugs were covered under Trump administration pricing deals, and how do 2026 price increases compare to years prior to the agreements?\",\n      \"suggestedTemplate\": \"debunk_claim\",\n      \"sourceBias\": \"center-left\",\n      \"debunkable\": 5\n    },\n    {\n      \"sourceSlug\": \"vera\",\n      \"title\": \"ICE Detention Population Reached Record High of 66,000\",\n      \"description\": \"Immigration detention rose 75% in 2025, with deportation ratio changing from 1:2 to 14:1\",\n      \"sourceUrl\": \"https://www.vera.org/explainers/weaponizing-the-system-one-year-of-trumps-attacks-on-due-process