rly 1.2 million casualties since February 2022, more losses than any major power in any war since World War II\",\n      \"researchQuery\": \"What are the verified casualty estimates for Russian forces in Ukraine from independent sources, and how do they compare to official Russian and Ukrainian claims?\",\n      \"suggestedTemplate\": \"debunk_claim\",\n      \"sourceBias\": \"left\",\n      \"debunkable\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"sourceSlug\": \"renewablematter\",\n      \"title\": \"Ukraine to File First Climate Reparations Claim Against Russia\",\n      \"description\": \"Ukraine preparing historic climate reparations claim estimating $43 billion in environmental damages\",\n      \"sourceUrl\": \"https://www.renewablematter.eu/en/2026-will-be-a-turning-point-for-climate-litigation\",\n      \"signals\": [\"breaking\"],\n      \"claim\": \"Ukraine estimates the cost of 236.8 million tonnes of CO2 equivalent generated by the Russian invasion at $43 billion and will file the first climate reparations claim in history\",\n      \"researchQuery\": \"What methodology is Ukraine using to calculate the $43 billion climate reparations figure, and what legal precedent exists for climate-based war reparations?\",\n      \"suggestedTemplate\": \"policy_analysis\",\n      \"sourceBias\": \"center\",\n      \"debunkable\": 4\n    },\n    {\n      \"sourceSlug\": \"skadden\",\n      \"title\": \"AI-Washing Securities Lawsuits Surge in 2026\",\n      \"description\": \"Companies face increasing litigation for misrepresenting AI capabilities and revenue projections\",\n      \"sourceUrl\": \"https://www.skadden.com/insights/publications/2026/2026-insights/litigation-controversy/ai-related-claims-and-other-securities-litigation-trends-to-watch\",\n      \"signals\": [\"trending\"],\n      \"claim\": \"Companies are facing securities class actions for AI-washing - making false claims about AI-driven efficiencies, misrepresenting legacy technology as AI, and exaggerating AI integration\",\n      \"researchQuery\": \"What specific AI-washing cases have been filed in 2025-2026, and what claims about AI capabilities were alleged to be fraudulent?\",\n      \"suggestedTemplate\": \"actor_investigation\",\n      \"sourceBias\": \"center\",\n      \"debunkable\": 5\n    },\n    {\n      \"sourceSlug\": \"wikipedia\",\n      \"title\": \"Supreme Court Evaluating Trump Tariff Authority Under IEEPA\",\n      \"description\": \"Court of Appeals ruled fentanyl and reciprocal tariffs exceed Presidential authority\",\n      \"sourceUrl\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tariffs_in_the_second_Trump_administration\",\n      \"signals\": [\"breaking\", \"controversial\"],\n      \"claim\": \"The Federal Circuit Court affirmed that Trump's fentanyl and reciprocal tariffs exceed the President's authority under IEEPA, with a Supreme Court ruling expected in early 2026\",\n      \"researchQuery\": \"What are the key legal arguments in the Supreme Court IEEPA tariff case, and what happens to collected tariff revenues if the Court rules them unlawful?\",\n      \"suggestedTemplate\": \"policy_analysis\",\n      \"sourceBias\": \"center\",\n      \"debunkable\": 5\n    },\n    {\n      \"sourceSlug\": \"factcheck\",\n      \"title\": \"Meta Ends Third-Party Fact-Checking Program\",\n      \"description\": \"Meta discontinued outside fact-checker partnerships that operated since 2016\",\n      \"sourceUrl\": \"https://www.factcheck.org/fake-news/\",\n      \"signals\": [\"controversial\", \"trending\"],\n      \"claim\": \"Meta's decision to end third-party fact-checking will increase misinformation spread, while studies show fact-check labels reduce engagement by 46% on reposts\",\n      \"researchQuery\": \"What impact did Meta's fact-checking program have on misinformation spread from 2016-2025, and what evidence exists about effectiveness of Community Notes alternatives?\",\n      \"suggestedTemplate\": \"debunk_claim\",\n      \"sourceBias\": \"center\",\n      \"debunkable\": 4\n    },\n    {\n      \"sourceSlug\": \"businesstoday\",\n      \"title\": \"Global Tech Layoffs Near 25,000 in January 2026\",\n      \"description\": \"Over 100 companies planning job cuts with AI cited as primary driver\",\n      \"sourceUrl\": \"https://www.businesstoday.in/technology/news/story/one-month-into-2026-global-tech-and-startup-layoffs-near-25000-514445-2026-02-03\",\n      \"signals\": [\"trending\"],\n      \"claim\": \"Tech sector eliminated 25,000 jobs in January 2026 alone, with 55% of hiring managers expecting layoffs and 44% citing AI as a top driver of workforce reductions\",\n      \"researchQuery\": \"What proportion of 2026 tech layoffs are directly attributable to AI automation versus cost-cutting, and what roles are most affected?\",\n      \"suggestedTemplate\": \"financial_investigation\",\n      \"sourceBias\": \"center\",\n      \"debunkable\": 5\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":124,"newStart":1,"newLines":184,"lines":["-{\r","-  \"topics\": [\r","-    {\r","-      \"sourceSlug\": \"bloomberg\",\r","-      \"title\": \"Wall Street Claims S&P 500 Will Rally for Fourth Straight Year to 7,269\",\r","-      \"claim\": \"Every Wall Street analyst surveyed predicts S&P 500 will rise by 5.8% to 7,269, marking the longest winning streak in nearly two decades\",\r","-      \"description\": \"Bloomberg survey shows unanimous analyst consensus on continued market rally despite elevated valuations and sticky inflation\",\r","-      \"sourceUrl\": \"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-12-29/bulls-only-every-wall-street-analyst-now-predicts-a-stock-rally\",\r","-      \"researchQuery\": \"What historical accuracy do Wall Street consensus predictions have, and what conditions led to multi-year rally streaks ending?\",\r","-      \"suggestedTemplate\": \"financial_investigation\",\r","-      \"sourceBias\": \"center\",\r","-      \"debunkable\": 4,\r","-      \"signals\": [\"trending\"]\r","